CI 实跑后 GitHub 报 annotation（已用 annotations API 独立核实，run 33514158624
与 33512433132 都有）：
  Node.js 20 is deprecated. The following actions target Node.js 20 but are
  being forced to run on Node.js 24: actions/checkout@v4, actions/setup-python@v5

上游最新（gh api repos/actions/{checkout,setup-python}/releases/latest）：
checkout v7.0.1、setup-python v7.0.0。

本地无法验证 v7 的行为（沙箱不跑 Actions），只能靠 push 后的 CI 实跑确认；
故单独成一个提交，若 CI 变红可只回滚这一条。

Co-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 .github/workflows/ci.yml | 8 ++++----
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/.github/workflows/ci.yml b/.github/workflows/ci.yml
index 71a8c1c..e7f1d3e 100644
--- a/.github/workflows/ci.yml
+++ b/.github/workflows/ci.yml
@@ -32,9 +32,9 @@ jobs:
     name: 测试（SQLite 后端）
     runs-on: ubuntu-latest
     steps:
-      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
+      - uses: actions/checkout@v7
 
-      - uses: actions/setup-python@v5
+      - uses: actions/setup-python@v7
         with:
           python-version: "3.11"
           cache: pip
@@ -73,9 +73,9 @@ jobs:
       PGUSER: postgres
 
     steps:
-      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
+      - uses: actions/checkout@v7
 
-      - uses: actions/setup-python@v5
+      - uses: actions/setup-python@v7
         with:
           python-version: "3.11"
           cache: pip
